    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tootum</strong> is a charming pixel art metroidvania game that immerses players in a magical world full of mysteries. With magic-based combat, a wide variety of items, and an engaging narrative, Tootum offers a rich experience in exploration and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/385f0bc25bdd7f39e78d83eaceeafd71.poster.avif?t=1755596173\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/385f0bc25bdd7f39e78d83eaceeafd71.webm?t=1755596173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/385f0bc25bdd7f39e78d83eaceeafd71.mp4?t=1755596173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an anonymous emissary of the enigmatic Magical Society, sent to the continent of Vonlar, which is being overrun by mystical creatures. It\u2019s up to you to investigate what\u2019s happening \u2014 but the world\u2019s deepest secrets will only be revealed to those who dare to venture deep into its hidden paths. The story is told through exploration itself, creating a naturally immersive and intriguing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/bc2e5a0085a6772029fe00055cd0d174.poster.avif?t=1755596173\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/bc2e5a0085a6772029fe00055cd0d174.webm?t=1755596173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/bc2e5a0085a6772029fe00055cd0d174.mp4?t=1755596173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic and Strategic Combat</strong>: Defeat monsters using spells that can be customized based on the chosen magic book. There are three books, each with unique traits that directly influence the player\u2019s playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Exploration</strong>: As you progress, you'll find hidden items that unlock new abilities, such as wall-jumping and agile movement, making progression dynamic and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customized Progression System</strong>: With the coins collected along the journey, you can purchase your magic book \u2014 your choice will shape your entire combat experience and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Indie Passion Project</strong>: Created by a solo developer, Tootum is the result of handcrafted work made with care and dedication. This personal touch is reflected in the atmosphere, mechanics, and attention to detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/4eec1ad24ff5225ad55ba6264e612119.poster.avif?t=1755596173\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/4eec1ad24ff5225ad55ba6264e612119.webm?t=1755596173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/4eec1ad24ff5225ad55ba6264e612119.mp4?t=1755596173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of metroidvania games and enjoy experiences that blend magic, mystery, and challenge, Tootum is an excellent addition to your library. Now available on Steam \u2014 don\u2019t forget to add it to your wishlist! The game may receive a launch week discount.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tootum</strong> is a charming pixel art metroidvania game that immerses players in a magical world full of mysteries. With magic-based combat, a wide variety of items, and an engaging narrative, Tootum offers a rich experience in exploration and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/385f0bc25bdd7f39e78d83eaceeafd71.poster.avif?t=1755596173\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/385f0bc25bdd7f39e78d83eaceeafd71.webm?t=1755596173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/385f0bc25bdd7f39e78d83eaceeafd71.mp4?t=1755596173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an anonymous emissary of the enigmatic Magical Society, sent to the continent of Vonlar, which is being overrun by mystical creatures. It\u2019s up to you to investigate what\u2019s happening \u2014 but the world\u2019s deepest secrets will only be revealed to those who dare to venture deep into its hidden paths. The story is told through exploration itself, creating a naturally immersive and intriguing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/bc2e5a0085a6772029fe00055cd0d174.poster.avif?t=1755596173\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/bc2e5a0085a6772029fe00055cd0d174.webm?t=1755596173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/bc2e5a0085a6772029fe00055cd0d174.mp4?t=1755596173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic and Strategic Combat</strong>: Defeat monsters using spells that can be customized based on the chosen magic book. There are three books, each with unique traits that directly influence the player\u2019s playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Exploration</strong>: As you progress, you'll find hidden items that unlock new abilities, such as wall-jumping and agile movement, making progression dynamic and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customized Progression System</strong>: With the coins collected along the journey, you can purchase your magic book \u2014 your choice will shape your entire combat experience and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Indie Passion Project</strong>: Created by a solo developer, Tootum is the result of handcrafted work made with care and dedication. This personal touch is reflected in the atmosphere, mechanics, and attention to detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/4eec1ad24ff5225ad55ba6264e612119.poster.avif?t=1755596173\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/4eec1ad24ff5225ad55ba6264e612119.webm?t=1755596173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210910/extras/4eec1ad24ff5225ad55ba6264e612119.mp4?t=1755596173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of metroidvania games and enjoy experiences that blend magic, mystery, and challenge, Tootum is an excellent addition to your library. Now available on Steam \u2014 don\u2019t forget to add it to your wishlist! The game may receive a launch week discount.</p>",
